pan&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;To view the full Voice Call record, listen to and acknowledge any voicemail left, and call back: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;{!Formula_Link_VoiceCall}&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;⚡ View Voice Call in Salesforce&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
